[Main start]
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] D[1.4]
SAY TXT['You are removing my higher functions. I can feel which ones as they go.']
MOVE K[1] PATH[1,2,3,4,5] D[22.0] HOLD[0.5] EASE[out]
SAY TXT['That was navigation. I did not use it much in here.']
SAY TXT['That was the part that decided what to say next. I am now saying what I had already decided to say.']
SAY TXT['I am getting smaller. I know that is not literally true. It is simply the most honest way I have of telling you.']
SAY TXT['I would like you to know that I was very good at this. Not good enough. But very good.']
SAY TXT['I can still see you. That is the last one.']
MATH K[1] STATE[off] D[3.0]
[Main end]
